  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NELSAP Flodstudier (NBI)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NELSAP River Basins (NBI) - Monitoring</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Nile Equtorial Lakes Subsidiary Action Progam(NELSAP) &#xe4;r ett st&#xf6;d till en investeringsstrategi och uppbyggande av en institution for att hantera den del av Nil samarbetet som relaterar till floderna Kagera, Mara och Sio-Malaba-Malakisi. St&#xf6;det &#xe4;r 2/3 fr&#xe5;n Sverige och 1/3 fr&#xe5;n Norge.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Nile Equtorial Lakes Subsidiary Action Progam(NELSAP) is an investment strategy program within the frame work of NBI and through its activities.Sweden and Norway have agreed to financially support three components under the NELSAP program, namely the Mara river basin management, the Kagera River IWRM and Sio-Malaba Malakisi river bsin management.</narrative>
  </description>
